Hi Dimitris,

This option is not available on Wallace. You can use the parameter 'userArgs' in the ENMevaluate function. To fill this parameter, you need to use the same structure as the dismo package. I'm sure that this tread is useful if you want to explore this option (maxent group <https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/maxent/yRBlvZ1_9rQ>). BTW, I'm not sure if this can work, I never tried.

Best,
Gonzalo

